# Next.js build output.
#
# This file went missing in the monorepo move (the repo root's .gitignore still
# carries a blanket "/apps" line instead). Its absence is not cosmetic:
# Tailwind v4's automatic source detection roots at this package and excludes
# whatever the .gitignore files at or below that root exclude. With no local
# .gitignore, it walked .next/ and extracted "utility candidates" out of the
# binary Turbopack cache — emitting a class like
#   .pb-[calc(env(j\1 \11 -...\1 )+1rem)]
# which then failed the CSS parser and 500'd every request. Turbopack cached
# the broken output, Tailwind rescanned it, and the loop sustained itself
# across cache wipes.
# Package-local deps. npm workspaces hoist almost everything to the repo
# root, but vitest and friends still write caches here.
/node_modules/

/.next/
/out/
/build/

# Test + tooling output
/coverage/
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# Vercel / TS
/.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
